# Accepted geometry, measured. Each line: <rule> <element label substring> <=<max excess px>  # why
# Tern's own .sf-tool-head sheet bleeds 6px on each side of its card so a hover background can bleed.
# Tern's own sheets bleed a little: the tool head by 6px each side so a hover background can bleed,
# the spinner icon by a rounding step. Measured, not argued.
spill-parent div.sf-tool-head <=12.5
spill-parent i.sf-tool-spin <=1
spill-parent div.sf-ck-ph <=4.5
